dnevnik-zhritsy-name = priestess's diary
dnevnik-zhritsy-desc = An elegant white notebook smeared with mud and brown stains. The pages are soaked with dark moisture faintly smelling of wilted lilies. The gentle handwriting breaks toward the end into weak, sweeping strokes.
dnevnik-zhritsy-content = [center][color=#4a3c6d][head=2]Records of the White Priestess[/head][/color][/center]


    {"[color=#4a3c6d][bold]Day the downpour began.[/bold][/color]"}

    {"[color=#2b2b2b]The sky has split open. This rain... it brings no life. The drops are black as tar and carry Corruption within them. Those touched by it do not die, but lose their reason, becoming immortal monsters driven only by blind rage. As the White Priestess, I must protect this temple and those praying within it. The prayer of cleansing takes away their pain, but the Corruption does not vanish. I take it into myself.[/color]"}


    {"[color=#4a3c6d][bold]Day Five.[/bold][/color]"}

    {"[color=#2b2b2b]The temple is half destroyed. Maddened parishioners broke down the oak doors and smashed the colonnade. My defenders hold them in the main nave. Each cleansing grows harder for me. My skin pales, and it feels as though liquid lead runs through my veins. [color=#8b0000]▓▒░██▒░[/color] today the first of them fell. The cursed rain touched his wounds, and he rose again, but no longer as our warrior. We had to bring a stone vault down upon him.[/color]"}


    {"[color=#4a3c6d][bold]Day Twelve.[/bold][/color]"}

    {"[color=#2b2b2b]We retreated to the farthest sanctuary behind the altar. My faithful knight remained at the entrance to block it with fallen columns. He swore to protect me until his last breath. I still hear his heavy steps and bestial growling beyond the heap of stone. He kept his oath. Even after losing his mind and becoming a monster of Corruption, he lets no one reach me.[/color]"}


    {"[center][color=#555555]░▒▓████[/color][/center]"}


    {"[color=#4a3c6d][bold]Final entry.[/bold][/color]"}

    {"[color=#2b2b2b]My body is almost entirely blackened by the Corruption I have gathered. I can no longer heal. I am only a fragile vessel, overflowing with another's curse, ready to crack at any moment."}

    {"The rain still beats upon the ruined roofs above. If someone finds these records... please, do not wake me.[/color]"}


    {"[center][color=#8b0000][bolditalic]Leave me sleeping in the dark.[/bolditalic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#1a1a1a]▓▒░█████████████████████████████▓▒░[/color][/center]"}

