klyatva-legionera-name = Legionary oath
klyatva-legionera-desc = I am a legionary. A legionary of the Great Empire of Therion! Before the Empire, the law, and my brothers-in-arms, I swear an oath of loyalty. I swear to fulfill my duty without fear or doubt, to obey the will of the Emperor, and to defend the Empire from its enemies, both foreign and within. I swear not to retreat before hardship, pain, temptation, or the threat of death. While my heart beats, I serve the Emperor. And even after my service ends, the name of legionary shall remain with me until the end of my days.

